# BUGS

There are no GPU or AUDIO gauges: there is no GPU compositing or audio service to read them from.
Only the last gauge, PACING, is named to assistive clients: the gauges are drawn as one box.
The tray has no replicants, and the menu has no About, Restart or Shut down: the launcher has nothing to power the machine off or restart it with.
`/proc/cpu` reopened after an idle spell reads the percentage last shown until proc's next sample, a second later; if proc restarts while it is open, the CPU gauge stops changing until the desktop next goes idle and active again.
The clock is UTC: there are no time zones.
